{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0174_1000_p", "source_sha256": "596ab5e78b3e616f342485213a9e81e0364fb6ee87d3ef29a65a80ef45ad8c83", "ja": "（紗代子やジュリア達が出演するドラマの撮影が、\n始まった。撮影は順調に進んでいるが……）", "zh": "（紗代子和茱莉亚等人出演的电视剧开始拍摄了。拍摄进展得很顺利，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0174_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "f5ec3b4808bdb5a2e16bfe0053d0f650952236c33aab890987f980654d5a61aa", "ja": "はあ……どうしたらいいんだろう……。", "zh": "唉……该怎么办才好呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0174_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0b31da88a04736a350d2d8bbe60fd6dd855ba4d189c0e56a75a5cda147b40575", "ja": "紗代子、少しは休憩したらどうだ？\n体を休めるのも仕事のうちだぞ。", "zh": "纱代子，要不稍微休息一下？\n让身体得到休息也是工作的一部分啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0174_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "2859d68ba941cb1ae4f65996bc028ead8fe819121edd2f6ea6586f4ce0756a75", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nけど、今は休んでいる場合じゃないんです。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n可是，现在不是休息的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0174_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "f7445c63f57190c0f9e5c895aa4272984b6989ff82093e0a2924cf4d6dcc4a7a", "ja": "次のシーンの撮影が始まる前に、どうしても\n解決しておかなくちゃいけないことがあって……。", "zh": "在下一场戏开始拍摄前，有件事无论如何都必须解决……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0174_1005_p", "source_sha256": "24f8a062ba0402a1b232e80c4ad21dd64296d5bd5415bf14a8d99f34ce1be3c7", "ja": "もしかして、演技上の悩みか？", "zh": "难道是演技方面的烦恼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0174_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "cc6d3061756a50474a883f425213b2cc0c4cbeaee40e321c3bd640e883457c90", "ja": "はい。最初のうちは、演技に集中できたんですけど。\n刑事役のジュリアのセリフが、残ってしまって……。", "zh": "是的。刚开始的时候，我还能集中精力演戏，可是……  \n饰演刑警的茱莉亚的台词，一直萦绕在我的脑海里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0174_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "d40cbd3fdf428afe490adcdb1d7013dacbdd7c8735c526037d13ec35a73da217", "ja": "刑事が怪盗の存在意義を問う、その言葉を聞いて……\n自分の役作りの甘さに気づいてしまったんです。", "zh": "听到刑警质问怪盗存在意义的那番话后……\n我才意识到，自己对角色的塑造还不够深入。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0174_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "d7dd62e38d8da69fde23653f64eab7db760099e4fb2bb60130fb48e3357f5a39", "ja": "私の役は、新米怪盗だから。お話の中で、少しずつ\n成長していけばと思っていたんですけど……。", "zh": "我的角色是个新手怪盗。所以我原本想着，她能在故事中一点一点地成长……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0174_1009_p", "source_sha256": "34066c9fb30ef9203aedb8bc0f67deabf7ebc4af43b8f30442e065e905ebca49", "ja": "それはつまり……怪盗として目指している場所とか、\n目標のようなもの……という話か？", "zh": "也就是说……是指作为怪盗所追求的方向，或者说目标之类的……对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0174_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "864a020855c5eb65092c36371c39b744b469ddc63254bd5a416f0d031a7d03e1", "ja": "はい！　私の役……怪盗『ハリーマウス』には、\nノーブルメロディという偉大な師匠がいます。", "zh": "是的！我所饰演的角色——怪盗“哈利鼠”，有一位伟大的师父，名叫诺布尔旋律。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0174_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "39a33f1a72a7e818f7391fe4ceddbd10d27f0e8fd26f2170b7daff655fd7b048", "ja": "怪盗としての美学を極め、ゆくゆくは\nノーブルメロディのような、一流の怪盗に……！", "zh": "将怪盗的美学贯彻到底，有朝一日\n成为像贵族旋律那样的一流怪盗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0174_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "78a6bdd976135affa47e8cdd13ad875d3f220af46e1ecf0cff4320d32cd80df2", "ja": "と、『ハリーマウス』が本気でそう思っているなら。\nもっと、必死なんじゃないかって。", "zh": "如果“哈利鼠”真的是这么想的，那应该会更加拼命才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0174_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ca5ea6118d4190adb410e520467b2d701b9629c4ad6fc36988801ce3dbca01ab", "ja": "うん。……違うと感じるのは、紗代子なりに、\n今の役に向き合えているからじゃないかな。", "zh": "嗯。……会觉得不对劲，正是因为纱代子在用自己的方式，认真面对现在的角色吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0174_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0af8df3477a9ff9475ded5799a2bbdb74594ea5d9d33ef3d5661efae2c7bbc9a", "ja": "なら、今のままでいい。師匠に追いつきたいという\n気持ちを、隠さずに食らいつくんだ！", "zh": "那就保持现在这样就好。别隐藏想要追上师父的心情，放手去拼吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0174_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "9012d41797be784e144950bffcc97d2a307b31496b0530fa59597e1689c03d11", "ja": "{$P$}……\nはい！　わかりました！", "zh": "{$P$}……\n好的！我明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0174_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "7ee0a7379ac791bf1b388ade984b91dbfcde88db5f3aaf93c57cb6a842a26d4a", "ja": "私、がんばります！\nそして必ず、師匠を超えてみせます！", "zh": "我会努力的！\n而且我一定会超越师父的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0174_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1d7690da2e61f1c96c8941ba756adb619c04605dad6679eefdd0230f0c16fd91", "ja": "その意気だ！\n……そろそろ撮影再開みたいだけど、いけるか？", "zh": "就是这个劲头！\n……好像差不多要重新开始拍摄了，你能行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0174_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "eb563999dd40f39eeb667363c298a637700276430980569f83b73a5e9eaf7cc2", "ja": "はい、{$P$}。\n今なら、思い切って演技ができそうです！", "zh": "好的，{$P$}。\n现在的话，我好像能放开手脚演戏了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0174_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "6aca6978c533aed8aea133e4d9b1e6135d725e9cf8679d57645409e80146113e", "ja": "偉大な怪盗の跡を継ぐ者として……\n必ず、演技で観客を魅了してみせます！", "zh": "作为伟大怪盗的继承者……\n我一定会用演技彻底征服观众！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0174_1020_p", "source_sha256": "e075e9eaba862bf969584ef231c1b1ff4c79dd004acb579a189a3d8dffe53a6d", "ja": "（紗代子はそう言うと、笑顔で撮影に戻っていった。\nこのドラマは、きっと最高の物語になるだろう！）", "zh": "（纱代子说完，便带着笑容回去继续拍摄了。这部电视剧一定会成为最棒的故事！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
